  "description": "Scentasy Matcha Magix is a unique and modern fragrance that blends creamy matcha tea with soft sweetness and smooth woody undertones. The scent feels fresh yet comforting, combining green tea freshness with a subtle gourmand twist. The opening introduces green matcha and soft citrus nuances that create a fresh and slightly creamy first impression. The heart develops into sweet milky accords and delicate florals, adding smoothness and a comforting character. The base settles into musk, vanilla, and light woods, leaving a clean and long-lasting trail that feels soft, cozy, and refined. Matcha Magix is perfect for those who enjoy green tea fragrances with a creamy gourmand edge.",
